%li.jpost#admin
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.fa.fa-plus
    %h3.name Office Manager

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        San Francisco, CA

      %p Nitrous.IO is searching for an office manager / magician who can help streamline day-to-day operations at the company.  The ideal candidate will be comfortable wearing many hats and is interested in challenging themselves in a variety of different capacities to keep up with our remarkable growth.

      %p This role is part finance, accounting, operations, HR and admin assistant all rolled-in to one.  The ideal candidate will have previous experience in an operating or finance position at a fast growing company.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Bank Reconcilliation
          %li Run payroll &amp; Expense reporting
          %li Enter and pay vendor bills
          %li Handle Visa and travel arrangements
          %li Maintain HR standards and organization charts
          %li Assist with food orders, event planning, etc...
          %li Assist with communicating with finance team
          %li Manage calendars for company executives
          %li Mail packages
          %li Schedule interviews / travel for candidates
          %li Handle new employee onboarding process

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Strong organizational and time management skills
          %li Able to juggle multiple priorities while paying attention to detail
          %li Experience processing payroll, expense reimbursements
          %li Quickbooks / Previous Bookkeeping experience
          %li Solid familiarity with basic office computing tools including Microsoft Word &amp; Excel
          %li Previous responsibility for major company accounts, HR or supporting exec team - a strong plus
          %li College Degree preferred but a creative, outgoing, result oriented personality with a can do attitude - a must

      %h4 Compensation
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Reports to Company CFO
          %li Full Time Position
          %li Competitive Salary, Health Coverage, Dental &amp; Vision, PTO and Holidays
          %li Monthly public transportation &amp; Gym subsidy

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Resume / LinkedIn
            %li A few paragraphs on why you like working for startups

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Corporate%20Assistant', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
